-- flee (with and without a `when within` radius) and a waypoint patrol, with the
-- player walking right so the distances change every frame.
player is {x: 20, y: 60}
zombie is {x: 60, y: 60, speed: 1}
cop is {x: 40, y: 30, speed: 1}
walker is {x: 10, y: 100, speed: 2}
zombie flees from player
cop flees from player when within 26
walker patrols along [{x: 10, y: 100}, {x: 100, y: 100}, {x: 100, y: 20}]
to update
  player.x is player.x + 2
to draw
  clear screen to black
  draw rect at player.x, player.y size 6, 6 in white
  draw rect at zombie.x, zombie.y size 6, 6 in red
  draw rect at cop.x, cop.y size 6, 6 in green
  draw rect at walker.x, walker.y size 6, 6 in yellow
run game with update and draw
